```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Sophie
    participant FE as Frontend React
    participant API as FastAPI
    participant DS as DocumentSource Router
    participant IR as Ingestion Router
    participant IS as StyleGuideIngestionService
    participant REPO as StyleGuideRepository
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant GCS as StorageClient / GCS
    participant TS as Temporal Starter
    participant WF as Temporal Workflow
    participant ACT as Temporal Activities
    participant DAI as Document AI
    participant LLM as Draft Pack Generator

    Sophie->>FE: sélectionne un PDF
    FE->>API: POST /api/style-guide/upload
    API->>DS: route upload
    DS->>IS: upload_document_source_pdf(file)
    IS->>GCS: upload_document_source_pdf(document_source_id, file)
    GCS-->>IS: storage_uri, generation, metageneration
    IS->>REPO: create_document_source(...)
    REPO->>DB: INSERT document_collection(EN_ATTENTE)
    REPO->>DB: INSERT document_source(EN_ATTENTE)
    DB-->>REPO: ok
    REPO-->>IS: document_source snapshot
    IS-->>DS: upload result
    DS-->>FE: 201 Created

    Sophie->>FE: lance l’ingestion
    FE->>API: POST /api/style-guide/document-sources/{id}/start-ingestion
    API->>IR: route start-ingestion
    IR->>IS: start_ingestion(document_source_id)
    IS->>REPO: prepare_ingestion_start(document_source_id)
    REPO->>DB: lock source + latest run
    REPO->>DB: INSERT document_ingestion_run(EN_COURS, UPLOAD)
    REPO->>DB: UPDATE document_source(EN_COURS)
    REPO->>DB: UPDATE document_collection(EN_COURS)
    DB-->>REPO: ok
    REPO-->>IS: run snapshot
    IS->>TS: start_style_guide_ingestion(payload)
    TS-->>IS: workflow_id
    IS-->>IR: ingestion result
    IR-->>FE: 202 Accepted

    TS->>WF: démarre workflow
    WF->>ACT: start_docai_job(payload)
    ACT->>IS: start_document_layout_parse(payload)
    IS->>DAI: start_document_layout_parse(...)
    DAI-->>IS: operation_id, output_uri
    IS->>REPO: record_layout_parse_result(...)
    REPO->>DB: UPDATE run current_step=LAYOUT_PARSE
    DB-->>REPO: ok
    IS-->>ACT: job started
    ACT-->>WF: job started

    loop polling Document AI
        WF->>ACT: check_docai_job(job)
        ACT->>IS: check_document_layout_parse(job)
        IS->>DAI: check_document_layout_parse(...)
        alt pas prêt
            DAI-->>IS: pending
            IS-->>ACT: None
            ACT-->>WF: None
        else prêt
            DAI-->>IS: parse result
            IS->>REPO: record_layout_parse_result(...)
            REPO->>DB: UPDATE extraction_steps_json SUCCEEDED
            DB-->>REPO: ok
            IS-->>ACT: parse result
            ACT-->>WF: parse result
        end
    end

    WF->>ACT: generate_draft_pack(parse_result)
    ACT->>IS: generate_draft_pack(parse_result)
    IS->>REPO: update run EN_COURS / LLM_DRAFT_PACK
    REPO->>DB: UPDATE document_ingestion_run
    DB-->>REPO: ok
    IS->>LLM: generate_draft_pack(...)
    LLM-->>IS: draft style pack
    IS->>REPO: replace_draft_style_pack(...)
    REPO->>DB: INSERT style_pack(BROUILLON)
    REPO->>DB: INSERT style_rule(A_VALIDER)
    REPO->>DB: UPDATE run A_VALIDER / HUMAN_REVIEW
    REPO->>DB: UPDATE collection A_VALIDER
    REPO->>DB: UPDATE source TERMINE
    DB-->>REPO: ok
    REPO-->>IS: draft_style_pack_id
    IS-->>ACT: draft result
    ACT-->>WF: draft result

    WF->>WF: state.status = PENDING_EDITOR_REVIEW
```
